%% Cell-to-Cell Anywhere v1 architecture
flowchart LR
    Caller[Caller Cell] --> Endpoint[Typed Endpoint]
    Endpoint --> Local{LocalAddr?}
    Local -->|yes| Kernel[Kernel IPC]
    Kernel --> LocalSvc[Local Service]
    Local -->|no| Broker[net-broker]
    Broker --> Export[Export Policy]
    Export --> Path[Path Manager]
    Path --> Direct[LAN TCP plus Noise]
    Path --> Relay[Self-hosted Relay]
    Direct --> RemoteBroker[Remote net-broker]
    Relay --> RemoteBroker
    RemoteBroker --> RemoteSvc[Exported Service]
